Neon Genesis Evangelion 2 (PS2, SLPS-25299) - English patch, BETA

You need your own clean dump of the Japanese game (Shinseiki Evangelion 2: Evangelions) as an .iso, and Python 3 (https://www.python.org/downloads/, tick "Add python.exe to PATH").

Windows: drag your .iso onto Apply_Patch.bat (or double-click it and paste the path).
Other:   python apply_patch.py your_game.iso EVA2_EN_beta.patch

A new file ending in _EN.iso is created next to your ISO; your original is untouched.
Play it in PCSX2 (or on a modded console). The patch checks that your ISO is the right one and verifies the result.

This is a BETA: some text may overflow, be cut off, or still be Japanese (image text such as the HUD is not translated yet). Please report problems with a screenshot and where in the game it happened.

